"<b>Configure Plugins...</b> from the <b>Settings</b> menu.\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...que KOrganizer atura Microsoft Exchange? Só habilite o engadido "
"<b>Microsoft® Exchange 2000 para KOrganizer</b> no diálogo <b>Configurar "
"Engadidos...</b> dende o menú de <b>Opcións</b>.\n"

#: tips.cc:16
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>...that you can select whether the week starts on Monday or on Sunday in "
"the KDE Control Center? KOrganizer uses this setting. Look at Regional & "
"Accessibility->Country/Region & Languages, then select the Time & Dates "
"tab.\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>...que pode escoller se a semana empeza o Luns ou o Domingo no Centro de\n"
"Control de KDE? KOrganizer emprega esta opción. Olle en Personalización ->"
